          "description": "Join soon-to-be-9-year-old Lola as she embarks on a journey to answer all your best questions. There will be facts, opinions and lots of theories to help kids be the smartest they can be. \n\nHow many people are in the world? Is a tomato a vegetable or a fruit? Enjoy Lola Wonders to find out. Listen at home, in the car, falling asleep and more. There’s always a question to be asked and there’s most likely an answer!",
